-- Transfer-Encoding and Content-Length
TE + CL, then a pipelined GET: 400 Bad Request
TE gzip + CL: 400 Bad Request
TE gzip: 400 Bad Request
TE chunked, identity: 400 Bad Request
TE chunked twice: 400 Bad Request
TE gzip, chunked: 501 Not Implemented
TE in HTTP/1.0: 400 Bad Request
TE Chunked (any case): 200 OK | echo:abc
CL 0 then CL 5: 400 Bad Request
CL 5 twice: 400 Bad Request
CL +5: 400 Bad Request
-- the request line and headers
bare LF in a value: 400 Bad Request
NUL in a value: 400 Bad Request
control in a name: 400 Bad Request
( in a name: 400 Bad Request
line folding: 400 Bad Request
space before the colon: 400 Bad Request
( in the method: 400 Bad Request
control in the target: 400 Bad Request
HTXX/1.1: 400 Bad Request
HTTP/1.9: 400 Bad Request
HTTP/2.0: 400 Bad Request
tab and UTF-8 in a value: 200 OK
-- chunked framing
bare LF lines: 400 Bad Request
junk after the size: 400 Bad Request
extensions and whitespace: 200 OK | echo:abcde
no CR LF after a chunk: 400 Bad Request
-- Host and limits
no Host in HTTP/1.1: 400 Bad Request
two Hosts: 400 Bad Request
no Host in HTTP/1.0: 200 OK
101 headers: 431 Request Header Fields Too Large
100 headers: 200 OK
a 17 KiB head: 431 Request Header Fields Too Large
-- Connection
keep-alive, close: 200 OK true
HTTP/1.0 keep-alive: 200 OK | 200 OK true true
-- 100 Continue after the responses before it
200 first: true
200 OK | 100 Continue | 200 OK | echo:hello
